 "preamble": "The clues lead to words which do not necessarily have the same number of letters as the corresponding lights. Before insertion in the diagram, figures must be substituted for any of the following Roman numerals (whether singly or in groups): I, V, X, L, C, D, M. The substituted figures are not necessarily the fewest possible from the Roman numerals which they replace. Thus, ALIVE might become A54E, A504E, A515E, or A5015E. The unchecked letters (taking all Is and Os to be figures) might be arranged to read: HURRY UP BERTS PATH. The sum of the digits in the complete diagram is 112. Punctuation is to be ignored.",
